{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae4a806ec3e6a748f7eee9bf4045ea3ed3faae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 6\\times 10,000 + 5\\times 1,000 + 4\\times 10 + 3\\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"352\" height=\"16\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57905c0bb6bb4fdbb72e84b0a201b24f7e16399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6,543 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 65,043 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 65,431 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 65,403 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 60,541$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"546\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787edb04ab20b05659db676ec68cdaed16a34c16.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = 60,000 + 5,000 + 40 + 3 = 65,043\\]\" width=\"304\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0cdd2d628e533bf874621ae1b229985f8e2996d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}.$\" sty